{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for all ages, <strong>Chicks In Trouble</strong>\u00a0offers a heart warming puzzle/action adventure that can be played by either mouse/touchpad or gamepad. Through our father Rooster's journey, you'll try to find your way to the lost chicks, avoid farm owners and animals, collect power ups and solve different puzzles to bring a happy ending into the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/3f5dedb8476bfeb752a088b0abe91026.poster.avif?t=1769177704\" width=312 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/3f5dedb8476bfeb752a088b0abe91026.webm?t=1769177704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/3f5dedb8476bfeb752a088b0abe91026.mp4?t=1769177704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>On a sunny farm where the daisies grow,</strong><br><strong>Mama hen was counting chicks in a row, </strong> <br><strong>But one by one they wandered away, </strong> <br><strong>\u201cHelp me dear rooster, find them today!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cluck, cluck, crow, here we go!</strong><br><strong>Through the gates and fields we flow, </strong> <br><strong>Jumping puddles, past the sheep, </strong> <br><strong>Every chick is ours to keep!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Over muddy trails, through the farmer\u2019s gate,</strong><br><strong>Dodging dogs and cats who wait, </strong> <br><strong>Into pipes where the echoes sing, </strong> <br><strong>Rooster calls out, \u201cFollow my wing!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cluck, cluck, crow, here we go! </strong> <br><strong>Through the gates and fields we flow, </strong> <br><strong>Jumping puddles, past the sheep, </strong> <br><strong>Every chick is ours to keep!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f55f1dffbeec9aa8569b9533bfe63632.poster.avif?t=1769177704\" width=312 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f55f1dffbeec9aa8569b9533bfe63632.webm?t=1769177704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f55f1dffbeec9aa8569b9533bfe63632.mp4?t=1769177704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048470?t=1769177704","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048470?t=1769177704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/cdd5b132c1b4b5fc7295ed8de3da724d670d60c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769177704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/cdd5b132c1b4b5fc7295ed8de3da724d670d60c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769177704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Stea